### ============================================
### 角色/菜单/用户-角色/系统配置 模块测试 (vellastra-auth :8081)
### ============================================

### 1. 角色列表
GET http://localhost:8080/role/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 创建角色
POST http://localhost:8080/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleName": "内容编辑",
  "roleCode": "EDITOR",
  "description": "内容编辑角色",
  "sortOrder": 2
}

> {% client.global.set("roleId", response.body.data); %}

### 3. 角色详情
GET http://localhost:8080/role/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 更新角色
PUT http://localhost:8080/role/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleName": "内容编辑-更新",
  "roleCode": "EDITOR",
  "description": "更新描述",
  "sortOrder": 2,
  "status": 1
}

### 5. 分配角色菜单
PUT http://localhost:8080/role/{{roleId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 5]

### 6. 查询角色菜单 ID
GET http://localhost:8080/role/{{roleId}}/menu-ids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 菜单树
GET http://localhost:8080/menu/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 创建菜单
POST http://localhost:8080/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuName": "评论管理",
  "menuType": 2,
  "parentId": 1,
  "path": "/comment",
  "component": "comment/index",
  "perms": "comment:list",
  "icon": "message",
  "sortOrder": 3
}

> {% client.global.set("menuId", response.body.data); %}

### 9. 菜单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/menu/{{menuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 更新菜单
PUT http://localhost:8080/menu/{{menuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuName": "评论管理V2",
  "menuType": 2,
  "path": "/comment",
  "component": "comment/index",
  "perms": "comment:list",
  "icon": "message",
  "sortOrder": 3,
  "visible": 1,
  "status": 1
}

### 11. 删除菜单
DELETE http://localhost:8080/menu/{{menuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 删除角色
DELETE http://localhost:8080/role/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 查询用户角色
GET http://localhost:8080/user/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. 分配用户角色
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1]

### 15. 系统配置 - 获取全部
GET http://localhost:8080/system/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. 系统配置 - 设置
PUT http://localhost:8080/system/config/site_name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

"星垂野博客"

### 17. 友情链接 - 列表
GET http://localhost:8080/system/friend-link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. 友情链接 - 新增
POST http://localhost:8080/system/friend-link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例友链",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "description": "示例网站",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

> {% client.global.set("friendLinkId", response.body.data); %}

### 19. 友情链接 - 删除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/system/friend-link/{{friendLinkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
